# Morphic Pool: the ruling - if you began the game with two or more opponents but only one is left, it enters tapped.
# Blightsteel Colossus hits Bot3 for 11 infect on turn 4, eliminating them with poison. With only Bot2 left, the Pool
# played on turn 6 enters tapped though the game began with two opponents.

